<TrustPage title="Privacy Policy" description="How this website handles visitor information, browser preferences and external links.">
  <h2>Information this site handles</h2>
  <p>This site does not provide account registration, comments or payment forms, and it does not intentionally collect names, email addresses or payment information.</p>
  <h2>Theme preference</h2>
  <p>If you switch between light and dark themes, the preference is stored locally in your browser. It is not sent to this website as an account profile.</p>
  <h2>Hosting logs</h2>
  <p>The hosting provider may process ordinary technical logs, such as IP address, browser information and requested URL, for security and delivery purposes.</p>
  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>This site uses Adsterra advertising. Adsterra and its advertising partners may process IP addresses, device and browser information, cookie or similar identifiers, and page-visit data to select, deliver, limit and measure advertisements and to prevent abuse. They may use cookies or similar technologies under their own privacy policies.</p>
  <p>You can control or clear cookies through your browser settings. Blocking advertising or storage technologies may affect whether some advertisements appear or work as expected.</p>
  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>Links to Steam, the game developer, YouTube and other sources are governed by the privacy policies of those services. Following an external link leaves this website.</p>
  <h2>Policy changes</h2>
  <p>This policy may be updated when the site changes its services or data practices. The current version will remain available on this page.</p>
</TrustPage>
